{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gf3CXiv4jpkLzDvvCpm3nu","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n  next_step?(array): string, explicit cursor for the next coding session\n  produced?(array): Entity, notes or artifacts created or updated\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    project: string, the Basic Memory project this session belongs to\n    started: string, when the session began or checkpoint was created\n    repository: string, stable repository identifier such as owner/name","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c8a2db0-7e64-4909-9e56-07b3c989741b","uuid":"77ac4308-bd25-4054-8b1e-e2f9eb2fc5ad","timestamp":"2026-11-03T13:02:04.999Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n  next_step?(array): string, explicit cursor for the next coding session\n  produced?(array): Entity, notes or artifacts created or updated\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    project: string, the Basic Memory project this session belongs to\n    started: string, when the session began or checkpoint was created\n    repository: string, stable repository identifier such as owner/name","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Gf3CXiv4jpkLzDvvCpm3nu","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgg3DPzv2xSY3jRdcE9kR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up for this repo. The smoke tests passed, and the schemas and settings are written. Because the output style is on, restart the session to get the proactive-capture behavior.\n\n- **Project:** I used the existing `main` project as the primary project. Creating a new `ufo` project at `~/basic-memory/ufo` failed because it would sit inside `main`'s directory tree. `main` was empty and is the only project, so nothing was displaced.\n- **Profile:** `coding`, with repository `ufo` (the directory name, since there is no git remote).\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task under `schemas/`. None existed before. The file on disk has the nested `schema` and `settings` frontmatter intact. The JSON read of the note returned `frontmatter: null`, so I confirmed this by reading the file itself.\n- **Placement:** The project was empty, so I stored a light suggested layout and nothing else. It uses `schemas/`, `sessions/`, `decisions/`, `tasks/` and `notes/`. The folders are created only when notes land in them.\n- **Settings:** These are in `.claude/settings.local.json`, so they're personal, not team-wide. They set `sessionProfile` to `coding`, `repository` to `ufo`, `captureEvents` to `true` and `outputStyle` to `basic-memory`.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills globally. `skills/` isn't tracked in this repo, so nothing was overwritten.\n- **Smoke test:**\n  - The open-decision query returned cleanly with 0 results.\n  - The schema query returned the 3 seeded schemas.\n  - `hook status` found the settings, project `main` and profile `coding`. It reported capture events on, 1 pending envelope, 0 archived and no flush yet. `checkpoint on compact` shows `off`, because I didn't change `preCompactCapture`.\n\nRecall is already live this session, and the PreCompact checkpoint works now too. Only the proactive-capture behavior waits for the restart.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":473,"cache_read_input_tokens":38806,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":473},"output_tokens":723,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c8a2db0-7e64-4909-9e56-07b3c989741b","uuid":"62566533-84ff-403c-ae06-0e922ca5781e","timestamp":"2026-11-03T13:02:11.748Z","request_id":"req_011Cgg3DPmGkPsKB2Q3jWLBJ"}
